#: 7a40895f01b745698ab79eeabf4c64a2
msgid ""
"For those that are not used to commandline, there are plenty ways to use gdb"
" for debugging with GUI. Here are some."
msgstr "对于不习惯命令行的用户，有很多带 GUI 的 gdb 调试方式。以下列举几种。"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging-with-gdb-on-linux.rst:85
#: a67f809a4bc84f2b901bb1013e2d7019
msgid ""
"For Ubuntu user, the default protections will prevent you to attach gdb to "
"SITL from IDE : see `here "
"<https://wiki.ubuntu.com/SecurityTeam/Roadmap/KernelHardening#ptrace%20Protection>`__."
" This will lead to an error message ``ptrace: Operation not permitted`` on "
"your first attempt to attach to a local process."
msgstr ""
"对于 Ubuntu 用户，系统默认保护机制会阻止从 IDE 将 gdb 附加到 SITL：参见`此处 "
"<https://wiki.ubuntu.com/SecurityTeam/Roadmap/KernelHardening#ptrace%20Protection>`__。首次尝试附加到本地进程时将出现错误信息"
" ``ptrace: Operation not permitted``。"

#: ../../source/docs/debugging-with-gdb-on-linux.rst:88
#: e53f2d71de0946239967e4f7226980b6
msgid "In this case, do one of the following:"
msgstr "遇到此情况，请执行以下操作之一："

#: ../../source/docs/debugging-with-gdb-on-linux.rst:90
#: a837b02b4291412796e7d9b0904aabbb
msgid "To disable this restriction temporarily, enter the command:"
msgstr "临时禁用此限制，请输入命令："

#: ../../source/docs/debugging-with-gdb-on-linux.rst:96
#: eb338d14ad354c46a325763d5e2f96a6
msgid ""
"To disable this restriction permanently, open the "
"``/etc/sysctl.d/10-ptrace.conf`` file for editing and change the line "
"kernel.yama.ptrace_scope = 1 to kernel.yama.ptrace_scope = 0. To apply the "
"changes immediately, enter the above command. Alternatively, run ``sudo "
"service procps restart`` or simply restart your system."
msgstr ""
"永久禁用此限制，请打开 ``/etc/sysctl.d/10-ptrace.conf`` 文件进行编辑，将 "
"kernel.yama.ptrace_scope = 1 改为 kernel.yama.ptrace_scope = "
"0。要立即应用更改，请输入上述命令。或者运行 ``sudo service procps restart``，也可直接重启系统。"

